# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: Matinee.
Package: Matinee
Section: Video
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: arm32, vfpv3
Depends: SharedUnixLibrary (>= 1.16), ARMEABISupport
Components: Apps.Video.!Matinee (Movable LookAt)
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-matinee
Description: Plex, Jellyfin and DLNA media client with a built-in player
 Browse films and TV on a Plex, Jellyfin or DLNA server and play them
 in Matinee's own window; the server converts what Matinee can't play.
 Continue watching, resume points, and hand-off to Reel. Plex is a
 trademark of Plex, Inc.; Matinee is not affiliated with it.
Build-Map: !Matinee -> Apps/Video/!Matinee
Build-Notice: Matinee, packaged for PackMan from the release zip on
 https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-matinee/releases
 .
 Matinee is under the GNU GPL version 2 or later and includes FFmpeg and
 other libraries, which keep their own licences. Licences follow.
Build-Copyright: !Matinee/docs/Licences
